{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setLocalStoreDirectory","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"path","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discardingExistingCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"path","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The event store’s directory, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" when no store is available."}]}]},{"name":"discardingExistingCache","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", any cache already present for this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directory must be deleted rather than loaded, and the backend must behave as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though it had never cached anything. The ensemble passes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" whenever the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store is being rebuilt, so a device starting over is guaranteed a full fetch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than a delta against a cursor from a previous incarnation."}]}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CustomCloudBackends"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Backends that cache remote state between launches should store that cache inside","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this directory. Doing so ties the cache’s lifetime to the event store’s: when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store is removed or rebuilt, the stale cache goes with it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Caching remote state anywhere with an independent lifetime (the system caches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory, for instance) is unsafe. Such a cache can outlive the event store it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"describes — surviving even app deletion — and a backend that then resumes an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"incremental fetch against a rebuilt cloud may never be told about files that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"predate its stale cursor. The device sees a partial cloud and reports no error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Called before priming, whenever the ensemble knows its event store. It is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"called for ensemble-independent operations such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble\/retrieveEnsembleIdentifiers(from:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", so implementations must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tolerate priming without it and simply forgo persistent caching in that case.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:9Ensembles20CloudFileSystemSetupP22setLocalStoreDirectory_23discardingExistingCacheySSSg_SbtF","modules":[{"name":"Ensembles"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setLocalStoreDirectory"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"discardingExistingCache"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"required":true,"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"abstract":[{"text":"Tells the file system which local directory belongs to the event store it is serving.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensembles\/cloudfilesystemsetup\/setlocalstoredirectory(_:discardingexistingcache:)"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CloudFileSystemSetup\/setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"title":"CloudFileSystemSetup Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CloudFileSystemSetup\/setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)-1faby"],"anchor":"CloudFileSystemSetup-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CloudFileSystemSetup"]]},"references":{"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CloudFileSystemSetup/setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)":{"role":"symbol","required":true,"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/cloudfilesystemsetup\/setlocalstoredirectory(_:discardingexistingcache:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setLocalStoreDirectory","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discardingExistingCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Tells the f